# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，Windows 批处理保持 CRLF
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换 / 不做文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary

# 文档在 GitHub 语言统计里不计入代码量
docs/** linguist-documentation
